---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What AIToolVerse collects, why, and how to delete it.">
  <article class="container-page max-w-3xl space-y-5 pt-14 leading-relaxed text-ink-700 dark:text-ink-200 [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:text-lg [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-ink-950 dark:[&_h2]:text-white [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ul]:pl-6">
    <h1 class="heading-lg">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <p>AIToolVerse helps you find AI tools. We collect as little as possible and never sell your data or show ads.</p>

    <h2>Without an account</h2>
    <p>Your assessment answers and saved tools are stored only in your browser's local storage. They are not sent to us. Clearing your browser data removes them.</p>

    <h2>With an account (Sign in with Google)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Sign-in data:</strong> your name, email address and profile photo from Google, held by Firebase Authentication to keep you signed in.</li>
      <li><strong>Your plan:</strong> your assessment answers (goals, tasks, interests, experience, budget) and saved tools, stored in our database so they sync across devices.</li>
      <li><strong>Suggestions:</strong> if you suggest a tool, we store the link, name and note with your user ID.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We use this data only to show your recommendations and to review suggestions.</p>

    <h2>Security and abuse prevention</h2>
    <p>We use Firebase App Check with Google reCAPTCHA to make sure requests come from our real website. reCAPTCHA is subject to Google's Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.</p>

    <h2>Service providers</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Cloudflare: website hosting and delivery.</li>
      <li>Google Firebase: sign-in and database.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not use analytics or advertising trackers. Links to tools take you to third-party sites with their own policies.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can view and change your answers any time, and delete your data and account from your dashboard ("Delete my data and account"). You can also email <a class="text-brand-700 underline dark:text-brand-300" href="mailto:support@aitoolverse.ai">support@aitoolverse.ai</a> to request access, correction or deletion. We respond within 30 days, in line with applicable laws such as India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act and the GDPR.</p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Account data is kept until you delete it. Inactive accounts may be removed after 24 months.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>AIToolVerse is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their data.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
